exists su name stream stdout ob bool truth be default ya
exists su name glm hello mind be mind as name "glm-4.7-flash:latest" fromtext text "You are a concise assistant. Reply in one short sentence." ya

su name hello stage ob text "hello world" for name glm hello mind to name text hello out be write do
su name hello out ob name text hello out be write do

su name hello stream stage ob text "say hello in five words" for name glm hello mind to name text hello stream out be write vyah stream do
su name hello stream out ob name text hello stream out be write do
